---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Stripe from "../resources/stripe-icon.jpg";
import Imperva from "../resources/imperva-logo.png";
import Amazon from "../resources/amazon-icon.svg";
---

<Layout title="Experience">
  <h1
    class="flex text-xl font-bold pb-8 justify-center xl:text-2xl xl:justify-start"
  >
    Professional
  </h1>

  <div class="pb-5 xl:pb-10">
    <div>
      <h2 class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-center text-lg xl:text-xl">
          <Image
            class="w-9 h-9 mr-5 rounded-md"
            src={Stripe}
            alt="Stripe Logo"
          />
          <a href="https://stripe.com/en-ca">Stripe</a>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs xl:text-base">Jan 2025 - Present</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="flex justify-between pl-1 pt-2">
        <p class="text-sm font-bold xl:text-base">Software Engineer</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs pl-1 pt-3 xl:text-sm">Building... 👷🚧</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pb-5 xl:pb-10">
    <div>
      <h2 class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-center text-lg xl:text-xl">
          <Image class="w-9 h-9 mr-5" src={Imperva} alt="Imperva Logo" />
          <a href="https://www.imperva.com/">Imperva</a>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs xl:text-base">May 2023 - Dec 2024</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="flex justify-between pl-1 pt-2">
        <p class="text-sm font-bold xl:text-base">Senior Software Engineer</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs pl-1 pt-3 xl:text-sm">
        I lead, designed, and executed on multiple cross-organization
        projects. I provided deeper knowledge surrounding our AWS infrastructure,
        and helped make high-level technical decisions across the team.
        <ul class="list-disc mt-5 text-xs pl-5 xl:text-sm">
          <li class="mb-1">
            Certified the <a
              class="underline font-bold"
              target="_blank"
              href="https://www.imperva.com/products/client-side-protection/"
              >Client-Side Protection</a
            > service for PCI DSS v4.0
          </li>
          <li class="mb-1">
            Migrated over 200 Cassandra tables across multiple regions with zero
            downtime
          </li>
          <li class="mb-1">
            Re-designed core algorithms and re-architected key components of the
            system to improve the efficacy of our service
          </li>
        </ul>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pb-5 xl:pb-10">
    <div>
      <h2 class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-center text-lg xl:text-xl">
          <Image class="w-9 mr-5" src={Amazon} alt="Amazon Logo" />
          <a href="https://aws.amazon.com/">Amazon/AWS</a>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs xl:text-base">Jul 2020 - May 2023</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="flex justify-between pl-1 pt-2">
        <p class="text-sm font-bold xl:text-base">
          Software Development Engineer I & II
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs pl-1 pt-3 xl:text-sm">
        I was on the Amazon Cognito team building and maintaining core services
        for authentication and authorization, handling scale of billions of
        requests per day globally.
        <br />
        <br />
        Prior to Amazon Cognito I was on the Tax Services team, building testing
        tools for internal business users.
        <ul class="list-disc mt-5 text-xs pl-5 xl:text-sm">
          <li class="mb-1">
            Designed and launched the <a
              href="https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2022/05/amazon-cognito-risk-evaluation-advanced-security-features/"
              class="underline font-bold"
              target="_blank">IP Address propagation feature</a
            > for unauthenticated requests to improve risk evaluation
          </li>
          <li class="mb-1">
            Automated region launch process for a microservice to save 50%
            developer time using CDK and helped launch <a
              href="https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/whats-new/2022/12/amazon-cognito-europe-milan-region/"
              class="underline font-bold"
              target="_blank">Amazon Cognito in the Milan region</a
            >
          </li>
          <li class="mb-1">
            Designed and implemented the algorithm to detect User Enumeration
            bot activity
          </li>
        </ul>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
